MIT-datasets.txt) and LICENSE (CC BY 4.0).

The converted streams in datasets/so-arm-recordings-remeasured/recordings/*/sim/measured/ are derived from 26 public
datasets on the Hugging Face Hub, each by its own author and under the licence its author gave it (the Apache License,
Version 2.0; the MIT License; or CC BY 4.0), each credited with its revision and licence in
datasets/so-arm-recordings-remeasured/NOTICE.md; the changes made are set out in datasets/so-arm-recordings/METHODS.md.

The converted recordings in datasets/weight-lifted/runs/ (measured.csv.gz, command.csv.gz, labels.tsv.gz) are derived
